BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of the magical River of Plenty. The r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      iver had a wondrous property: any gift cast into its waters would emerge on the far shore ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      tripled in abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    The Elder of the First Village possessed five loaves of bread each moon. She could choose to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (       keep all five, or cast some into the river for the Second Village. Whatever arrived-fifte) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      en times what she sent-belonged to the Second Village's Elder, who then decided what to se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      nd back across the waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    At first, fear ruled both shores. "What if I give and receive nothing?" worried the First El) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      der. "What if they expect too much in return?" fretted the Second Elder.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    But one wise woman said: "The river multiplies gifts, not because it demands perfection, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (       because it rewards the courage to begin. Send with open hands, return with grateful heart) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      s, and both villages shall flourish.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    When both Elders embraced this wisdom-giving generously and returning fairly-the River of Pl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      enty flowed abundantly. The villages learned that trust, once begun, creates more than eit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      her could hoard alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    The river still flows, teaching that prosperity springs not from grasping, but from the sacr) Tj ET
