BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of the magical River of Plenty. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (         river had a wondrous property: any gift cast into its waters would emerge on the far sh) Tj ET
