BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        ifteen times what she sent-belonged to the Second Village's Elder, who then decided what) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (         to send back across the waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      At first, fear ruled both shores. "What if I give and receive nothing?" worried the First ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (        Elder. "What if they expect too much in return?" fretted the Second Elder.) Tj ET
