BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      Myth: When the Well Runs Dry) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      The First Guardian stood at the dried well, remembering their offering of four acorns-thei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        r gesture of renewed faith after the storm. They had written: "I believe in us again. I ) Tj ET
