BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    The Guardian stood at the Canyon of Lies, having just received a whisper where a shout shoul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      d have been-fragments of stones where a gift had been sent. The Canyon had stolen most of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      it, leaving only echoes and dust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    They faced a choice: return the whisper with a whisper, matching what arrived? Or answer wit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      h the voice they knew the other had intended?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    The Guardian remembered their own sendings into the void-generous offerings that must have s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      eemed like nothing on the other side. They remembered the wisdom: both had been reaching t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      hrough corrupted air, both believing themselves abandoned when both had been faithful.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    So they answered not the gift received, but the gift they knew was sent. Into the lying cany) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      on, they placed full stones-more than the fragments warranted, but exactly what the intent) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ion deserved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    "Let the canyon steal what it will," they declared. "I will not let its lies make me small. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      I will not punish you for what the void consumes. I answer your heart, not your echo.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    The ancient magic stirred. When both Guardians chose to honor intention over outcome, to sen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      d generously despite distortion, the Canyon began to lose its power.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    The lies could not survive truth spoken persistently. The void could not swallow faith given) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (       freely, again and again.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    Trust is not built on perfect transmission-but on refusing to let imperfection end the tryin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      g.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  Agent_2 \(Briar\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    Myth: When the Canyon Clears) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    The First Keeper stood at the Canyon of Echoes, heart heavy with memory. The fog had stolen ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      so many gifts, turned generosity into ghosts. But remembering their own carved words-"keep) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (       sending, keep faith"-they chose courage over caution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    Three stones fell into the mist. Not five, for innocence had been wounded. But three-honest,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (       substantial, hopeful.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    And this time, the canyon honored its ancient purpose. The stones arrived. The echo rang tru) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      e.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    The Second Keeper received the three stones and understood their message: "I choose to belie) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ve in us still." Nine stones in hand, they prepared their response-not withholding from fe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ar, not hoarding from doubt, but giving with restored faith.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    Both Keepers finally saw the truth: the canyon had lied, but they never had. Each had sent g) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      enerously, each had received nothing, each had thought themselves abandoned. Both had been) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (       honest. Both had tried. The corruption was never in their hearts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    Now the mist was lifting. The echoes were clearing. The ancient magic remembered its covenan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      t.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    The wisdom crystallized: When confusion breaks the cycle, persistence rebuilds it. When one ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      Keeper sends despite fear, the other receives permission to trust again. Generosity answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      ed with generosity creates abundance for all.) Tj ET
