BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      After many rounds of lies and mist, the Guardian sent three stones-not all they had, for w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        ounds needed acknowledgment, but enough to say: "I still believe in us.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      The stones crossed the Canyon untouched. Three became nine in faithful hands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      The Second Guardian held those nine stones and understood: this was not just a gift but a ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        question. "Will you honor persistence? Will you prove the Canyon has not won?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      They could have kept six, returned three-a careful, guarded response to scarred trust. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        y could have hoarded against future fog.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      Instead, they chose differently.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      They returned with fullness-not counting stones for stones, but answering courage with cou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (        rage, faith with faith. "You sent despite uncertainty," they declared. "I return with ce) Tj ET
