BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      The ancient pattern emerged: When both Keepers send generously without waiting for perfect) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (         proof, when both honor intention before outcome, when both refuse to let noise silence ) Tj ET
