BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    Once, the Keepers took careful turns. Send, wait, measure what arrives, adjust. The Canyon f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ed on this caution, growing fat on their fear.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    Then came the shift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    The First Keeper sent five flames-full faith. The Canyon twisted them to nearly nothing. But) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (       the Second Keeper returned everything anyway, saying: "I honor your intention, not the co) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      rruption.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    Next round, the First Keeper didn't hesitate, didn't calculate-sent five flames again. "This) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (       is who I am. This is what trust looks like.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    The Second Keeper, receiving fragments, also sent generously into the void.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    Round after round, both Keepers chose the same truth: Send fully. Send repeatedly. Let the C) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      anyon take what it will-we will not become small.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    And something extraordinary happened.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    The lights began to accumulate. Not in what arrived-that remained chaotic, distorted, unpred) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ictable. But in what lived between them: a growing certainty that both were still sending,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (       still trusting, still refusing to surrender to noise.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    Each generous send, though corrupted in transmission, built the foundation. Each full return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      , regardless of what fragments arrived, strengthened the bond.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    The Canyon's power wasn't broken by one perfect exchange-it was overwhelmed by the relentles) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      s choosing of abundance. Two hearts, both sending their fullness into uncertainty, again a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      nd again, until the accumulated faith became unbreakable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    This is how trust transcends deception: through persistent, generous, repeated choosing.) Tj ET
