BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (    The Canyon devoured hungrily. Five brilliant flames entered the mist. A single flicker emerg) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      ed on the other side-barely enough to see, a whisper of what was sent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    The Second Keeper received that tiny spark and wept-not from disappointment, but from recogn) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      ition. "Five flames were sent," they said. "The void ate four and nine-tenths. But the hea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      rt that sent them burns undimmed.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    Without hesitation, they returned the entire spark. Not because it was significant in size-i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      t wasn't. But because returning all of it declared: "I see your whole flame, not what the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      darkness left. I honor what you gave, not what arrived.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    When the First Keeper received back that small but complete return, they understood: both we) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      re now speaking the same language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    The ancient truth crystallized: When one pours out everything and another returns everything) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (       received-however small-they create something the void cannot corrupt. Not an exchange mea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      sured in quantities, but a covenant measured in totality.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    The Canyon cannot diminish what is given completely and honored fully.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    Two whole hearts speaking across darkness will always outshine the lies between them.) Tj ET
